sequenceDiagram
    title Quản lý nhà cung cấp
    actor Employee
    participant AdminPortal
    participant API
    participant SupplierService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Employee->>AdminPortal: Mở danh sách nhà cung cấp
    AdminPortal->>API: GET /suppliers
    API->>SupplierService: List suppliers
    SupplierService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT suppliers
    PostgreSQL-->>SupplierService: Supplier list
    API-->>AdminPortal: 200 list
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Tạo hoặc cập nhật nhà cung cấp
    AdminPortal->>API: POST or PATCH /suppliers
    API->>SupplierService: Validate supplier data
    SupplierService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT or UPDATE supplier
    PostgreSQL-->>SupplierService: Saved supplier
    API-->>AdminPortal: 200 or 201 supplier
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Xóa nhà cung cấp
    AdminPortal->>API: DELETE /suppliers/:supplierId
    API->>SupplierService: Check import references
    SupplierService->>PostgreSQL: DELETE supplier
    PostgreSQL-->>SupplierService: Result
    API-->>AdminPortal: 204 deleted or 409 conflict
